'convex.governance

;; Reserved genesis stub for network governance logic (see #414, governance trust
;; monitor). Deployed at genesis and registered in CNS under the top-level name
;; `convex.governance` (deliberately not `convex.trust.governance`, despite living
;; in the trust source tree): governance is expected to outgrow the trust family.
;; Genesis is frozen, so logic will be added via a protocol migration or a
;; governance patching transaction when designed — decision recorded on #623.